sequenceDiagram
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant W as Worker
    S->>P: Record due run and advance<br/>trigger in one transaction
    Note over S,W: Check availability and start<br/>the worker if needed
    S->>P: Mark run dispatching
    S->>W: Submit file task<br/>with schedule key
    Note over S,W: Worker commits task and receipt<br/>to private SQLite
    W-->>S: Task ID (response lost)
    S->>W: Retry with the same key
    W-->>S: Return original task ID
    S->>P: Record task ID and state
